SUMMARY:CCE Citywide Bike Swap
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our 13th year of the Cesar Chavez Elementary (CCE) Citywide Bike Swap Fundraiser where you can…. \nBUY A BIKE… great deals on gently used bikes and accessories for kids and adults! \nDONATE A BIKE… CCE receives 100% of the sale price\, which is tax deductible. (*Please see bottom of this page for information about donations from other schools) \nSELL A BIKE… we’ll try to sell your bike for you. If we do\, you get 75% of sale price & CCE receives 25% – which is tax-deduction for you. (Pre-registration available at our website!) \nLast year we sold over 400 bikes at the Swap!! Both adult and kid size bikes and bike-related accessories (such as bike trailers) will be available. This is a fun and affordable way for growing kids to get the next size bike and\, for those donating or selling bikes\, you can free up garage space while supporting Davis school PTA programs! Donated bikes/accessories and 25% commissions are TAX-DEDUCTIBLE. \nDrop off times for donated and consigned bikes are Saturday\, April 11 from 3-6pm & Sunday\, April 12 before the swap from 7-9am in front of Cesar Chavez Elementary\, 1221 Anderson Road\, Davis\, CA. \nThis event is also a fundraiser for all participating Davis schools! To find out how your school can become a participating school\, visit our website listed below. \nAND again this year: At the Swap you can register your bike with the City of Davis Bike Index – a part of a nationwide bike registry!! \nFor more info or to preregister consignment bikes or to volunteer to help\, visit our website:  www.davisbikeswap.org OR email davisbikeswap@gmail.com
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/cce-citywide-bike-swap/
LOCATION:Cesar Chavez Elementary\, 1221 Anderson Road\, Davis\, CA\, 95816\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Fitness,Outside,Sports
ORGANIZER;CN="Cesar Chevez SIPAT (PTA)":MAILTO:sladegast@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
