SUMMARY:Knots 101: Practical Knots for Home\, Camp\, and Beyond
DESCRIPTION:Knots are one of those skills you don’t realize you need\, until you really need them! In this hands-on adult/family class\, participants will learn a set of practical\, easy-to-remember knots that are useful for everyday life\, camping trips\, and outdoor adventures. \nWe’ll cover tensioning knots\, grabbing knots\, loop knots\, and other essential knots that can be used for everything from securing loads and tarps to setting up shelters and solving real-life problems. This class is designed to be approachable for beginners and engaging for all ages. \nThis is a great standalone class\, and also an excellent foundation for the following week’s Shelter & Survival class. All materials will be provided. \n12 and under must come with an adult. 5 and under free. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/knots-101-practical-knots-for-home-camp-and-beyond/
CATEGORIES:Community,Outside
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Knots-Shelter-Flier_TheDirt.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Davis Forest School":MAILTO:programs@davisforestschool.org
END:VEVENT
