SUMMARY:2026 Wennberg Orchestra Festival
DESCRIPTION:Event Details: \n2026 Wennberg Orchestra Festival\nSunday\, April 12\, 2026\, at 2:30 PM\nMondavi Center\, Jackson Hall\, UCD\nDoors Open to Lobby 1:30 PM\nDoors Open to Jackson Hall 2:00 PM \nMaster of Ceremonies-Dr. Andy Jones\, UC Davis Professor of Writing and Poetry\, Poet Laureate emeritus of Davis.\nSponsored by the DHS-Holmes Orchestra Boosters\, the Wennberg Family\, and the Jim Kidd Foundation For The Arts. \nTicket Information:\nGeneral Admission- Child $15\, Adult $25\, plus $3.50 Mondavi service charge.\nhttps://www.mondaviarts.org/…/2026-wennberg-orchestra…/ \nMondavi Center Parking:\nParking on event day is free but guests must go through the special event parking portal\, https://ucdavis.aimsparking.com\, select special event parking\, then Mondavi Center\, and choose “Wennberg” from the list. Select the “$0 permit” and after entering car info the permit will be issued. \nProgram Order: \nDavis Elementary All City Orchestra\, Directed by Lydia Cooley\nDavis High Strings Tutoring Program Orchestra\, Directed by student conductor\, Haoching Liu\nDirected by Angelo Moreno\nHolmes Junior High Intermediate Orchestra\nHolmes Junior High Advanced Orchestra \nINTERMISSION \nDirected by Angelo Moreno\nDHS Baroque Ensemble\nDHS Chamber Orchestra\nDHS Symphony Orchestra\nFeaturing: 2026 Davis High Concerto Competition Winners\, Pianist Eva Wilson\, and Violinist Kiran Thole.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/2026-wennberg-orchestra-festival/
LOCATION:Jackson Hall\, Mondavi Center
CATEGORIES:Music
